{{!
    @template paygw_mercadopago/switch_to_card

    Trocar Pix/boleto por cartao guardado - so PARA A FRENTE, sem cobrar nada
    agora. Reusa o mesmo formulario de captura de cartao de subscribe.php,
    via a partial card_fields - e o mesmo card_form.js que ja tokeniza para
    la que tokeniza para ca.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formaction string
    * sesskey string
    * cancelurl string
    * brick bool
    * direct bool
    * native bool

    Example context (json):
    {
        "formaction": "https://exemplo.test/payment/gateway/mercadopago/switch_to_card.php?ref=mdlsub-1-2-abc",
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "cancelurl": "https://exemplo.test/local/marketplace/mysubscriptions.php",
        "brick": true,
        "direct": false,
        "native": false
    }
}}
<div class="paygw-mercadopago-switch">
    <p class="lead">{{#str}} switchtocardexplain, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</p>

    {{> paygw_mercadopago/card_fields }}

    <p><a href="{{cancelurl}}">{{#str}} switchtocardcancel, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}</a></p>
</div>
